Package: klipper-connect
Architecture: any
Depends: python3 (>= 3.9), ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: alejandro-md-keyring
Description: Prusa Connect bridge for Klipper printers
 Runs next to Moonraker and makes a Klipper printer show up in Prusa
 Connect: status, telemetry, files, starting and stopping prints, camera
 snapshots. Supports the MK3S and the MINI.
 .
 One bridge per printer runs as the klipper-connect@NAME systemd service.
 Set one up with `sudo klipper-connect-setup`; nothing is started on install.
